  "cited_article_id": "post-payments-and-remittances",
  "reply": "To fix the misapplied payments, open **Billing > Ledger History**, find each incorrect transaction, and click **Reverse Allocation**. After the reversal, return to **Billing > Payment Processing**, select the appropriate batch under **Unposted Remittances**, and reapply the funds to the correct invoice lines using **Match Invoices** or manual entry. Ensure you have the Billing Specialist role and that the billing period is not closed."
}
